َبْدِلِي", "plain": "أَبْدِلِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/295548fbab346b8d769e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "أَبْدِلَا", "plain": "أَبْدِلَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/e7add382abe2fdd0f144.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "أَبْدِلُوا", "plain": "أَبْدِلُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/007e367608353bc5e03e.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "أَبْدِلْنَ", "plain": "أَبْدِلْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/b22be7d981345f8324ec.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "18:81", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2221.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And we intended that their Lord should change him for them for one better in purity and nearer to mercy.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"İstedik ki Rabbleri onun yerine kendilerine ondan temizlikçe daha hayırlı ve daha çok merhamet eden birini versin.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو ہم نے چاہا کہ ان دونوں کا رب اس سے بہتر ستھرا اور اس سے زیادہ مہربانی میں قریب عطا کرے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan kami menghendaki, supaya Tuhan mereka mengganti bagi mereka dengan anak lain yang lebih baik kesuciannya dari anaknya itu dan lebih dalam kasih sayangnya (kepada ibu bapaknya).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَرَدْنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُبْدِلَهُمَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5d8674119de15d485238.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zamijeni im", "en": "give them in exchange", "tr": "onlara karşılık ver", "fr": "échange pour eux", "id": "menggantikan keduanya", "ur": "وہ ان دونوں کو بدل دے", "bn": "তিনি তাদের বদলে দেবেন", "fa": "آن دو را جایگزین کند"}}, {"text": "رَبُّهُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَيْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "زَكَوٰةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَقْرَبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رُحْمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يُبْدِلَهُمَا", "count": 1, "first": "18:81", "audio": "audio/5d8674119de15d485238.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huma"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "zamijeni im", "en": "give them in exchange", "tr": "onlara karşılık versin", "fr": "qu'il leur donne en échange", "id": "agar dia menggantikan mereka berdua", "ur": "انہیں بدلے میں دے دو", "bn": "তাদের বিনিময়ে দাও", "fa": "در عوض به آنان دهد"}}, {"arabic": "يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ", "count": 1, "first": "66:5", "audio": "audio/7a903871a5f58de234a5.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "he gives him in exchange", "bs": "zamijeni mu", "tr": "ona karşılık versin", "fr": "qu'il lui donne en échange", "id": "agar dia menggantikannya", "ur": "وہ اسے بدلے میں دیتا ہے", "bn": "সে তাকে বিনিময়ে দেয়", "fa": "در عوض به او دهد"}}, {"arabic": "يُبْدِلَنَا", "count": 1, "first": "68:32", "audio": "audio/7b073a28e9f7f46eb6ce.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "he gives us in exchange", "bs": "zamijeni nam", "tr": "bize karşılık versin", "fr": "qu'il nous donne en échange", "id": "agar dia menggantikan kami", "ur": "وہ ہمیں بدلے میں دیتا ہ